{"id": "gaokao_math_2015_henan_445_06", "answer": "B", "raw_response": "根据题意，米堆为圆锥的四分之一。\n设圆锥底面半径为 $r$，高为 $h=5$。\n由题意知，米堆底部的弧长为 $8$ 尺，即 $\\frac{1}{4}$ 个圆周长。\n所以 $\\frac{1}{4} \\times 2\\pi r = 8$。\n取 $\\pi \\approx 3$，则 $\\frac{1}{4} \\times 2 \\times 3 \\times r = 8$，解得 $1.5r = 8$，即 $r = \\frac{16}{3}$。\n\n米堆的体积 $V$ 为圆锥体积的 $\\frac{1}{4}$：\n$$V = \\frac{1}{4} \\times \\frac{1}{3}\\pi r^2 h$$\n$$V = \\frac{1}{12} \\times 3 \\times \\left(\\frac{16}{3}\\right)^2 \\times 5$$\n$$V = \\frac{1}{4} \\times \\frac{256}{9} \\times 5$$\n$$V = \\frac{64}{9} \\times 5$$\n$$V = \\frac{320}{9} \\approx 35.56 \\text{ (立方尺)}$$\n\n已知 1 斛米的体积约为 1.62 立方尺，\n则堆放的米约有：\n$$\\frac{35.56}{1.62} \\approx 21.95 \\text{ (斛)}$$\n\n估算结果约为 22 斛。\n\n<answer>B</answer>", "model": "qwen3.6-35b-a3b", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 2097, "completion_tokens": 2758, "total_tokens": 4855, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 2385, "text_tokens": 373}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"image_tokens": 1872, "text_tokens": 225}}, "choice_mode": "single", "evaluation_protocol": "choice_aware_v2"}
